@abeldekat, with the recent improvements to 'mini.notify' (which were in half prompted by this "Show and tell"), the following implementation of content.format is now possible and is slightly cleaner:
local format = function(notif)
  return notif.data.source == 'lsp_progress' and notif.msg or MiniNotify.default_format(notif)
end
vim.api.nvim_set_hl(0, 'MiniNotifyLspProgress', { link = 'Comment' })

